],[2,5,5],[5,2,3]]. - Choose the third and fourth triplets [[2,5,3],[2,3,4],[2,5,5],[5,2,3]]. Update the fourth triplet to be [max(2,5), max(5,2), max(5,3)] = [5,5,5]. triplets = [[2,5,3],[2,3,4],[2,5,5],[5,5,5]]. The target triplet [5,5,5] is now an element of triplets.</p> <p>Constraints:</p> <ul> <li> <p><code>1 &lt;= triplets.length &lt;= 105</code></p> </li> <li> <p><code>triplets[i].length == target.length == 3</code></p> </li> <li> <p><code>1 &lt;= a_i_, b_i_, c_i_, x, y, z &lt;= 1000</code></p> </li> </ul> Code and Explanation <pre><code>=== "Optimal"
